# === OS / editor junk ===
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
.idea/
*.iml

# (Flutter build + tooling — app/build/, app/.dart_tool/, etc. — are covered
#  by app/.gitignore, which applies within the app/ subtree.)

# === PocketBase backend ===

# Per-platform binary — not source. Download v0.39.9 per deploy/DEPLOY.md.
backend/pocketbase
backend/pocketbase.exe

# Runtime state: the SQLite database, logs, auth secrets, and generated
# types. The schema lives in pb_migrations/ and is fully reproducible, so the
# data must NEVER be committed (it also contains superuser credentials).
backend/pb_data/

# NOTE: backend/pb_public/ (the built Flutter web app) IS tracked on purpose —
# the always-on Linux box has no Flutter to build it, so it receives the
# frontend via `git pull`. Rebuild with scripts/build-web.ps1 and commit the
# result whenever the app changes.

# PocketBase's own distribution docs (shipped alongside the binary).
backend/CHANGELOG.md
backend/LICENSE.md
